 "decision_rule": "Separately per budget. A mode M in {sigreg,both} BEATS_EMA when, over both regimes x 5 folds (10 runs): (1) healthy start: commit_eligible(M) >= 8 and >= commit_eligible(ema); median held-out prediction_mse/copy_baseline_mse of M <= that of ema; median in-batch retrieval top-1 of M >= that of ema; (2) shrunk start: noncollapse_pass(M) >= 8 and > noncollapse_pass(ema). If both qualify, the lower healthy median ratio wins. The runtime default changes from ema only if a mode BEATS_EMA on the runtime budget; a stress-only win is recorded as a hint, not a default change. Otherwise DEFAULT_STAYS_EMA. No other outcome changes code."
